#! btw 1
#! name: a commit message, 122
#! license: CC0-1.0
#! visibility: public
# commit-message-122: any words are a phrase (CC0-1.0, original). A commit message has no curated scansion, so its stress is worked
# out: the small words (the, and) are weak and the first syllable of every other word is strong, which here gives nine syllables
# with the stress on make, drop, deeper, move and kick. They are accented and sit on the beats; the weak ones fall between. It
# is a two-bar line in the straight feel, sung four times in each eight-bar section. `check` says what the phrase gave.
arrange from template(deep-house, "make the drop deeper and move the kick")
